WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:23.060
They watched Him rise until the cloud received Him.

2
00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:28.780
And stood there staring at an empty sky.

3
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:35.360
Two angels came and asked them gently.

4
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.240
Why are you looking up?

5
00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:47.300
What looked like leaving was a promise kept:

6
00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:53.480
I will not leave you here alone.

7
00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.160
Two walked a road with hearts too heavy to see.

8
00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:08.100
He broke the bread, and then they knew.

9
00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:15.420
He ever lives — He is not gone.

10
00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:20.660
Panteles — to the uttermost,

11
00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:30.100
Completely, for all time, for anyone.

12
00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:35.960
No gatekeeper stands at His door.

13
00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:46.820
That burning is not ancient history.

14
00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:53.360
It is alive in any road you walk.

15
00:01:55.040 --> 00:02:00.780
A warmth of heart, a conscience growing clear.

16
00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:07.380
A pull toward goodness in the dark.

17
00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:15.060
The question is not was my lamp once lit?

18
00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:21.180
But is it burning still today?

19
00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:29.140
His grace is not just words that leave you where you are.

20
00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:37.380
It is a power that can change.

21
00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:43.620
He ever lives — He is not gone.

22
00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:48.800
Panteles — to the uttermost,

23
00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:58.220
Completely, for all time, for anyone.

24
00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:04.180
No gatekeeper stands at His door.

25
00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:11.600
Whatever looking back has cost you,

26
00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:17.980
The plow is still in the field.

27
00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:26.820
Whatever name you carry, wherever you have been,

28
00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:33.440
The choice to turn is here.

29
00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:40.740
He ever lives — He is not gone.

30
00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:46.740
Panteles — to the uttermost,

31
00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:55.220
No gatekeeper stands at His door.

32
00:03:57.400 --> 00:04:05.020
He lives — come walk with Him today.

33
00:04:07.420 --> 00:04:09.460
He is present.

34
00:04:09.940 --> 00:04:13.180
Always, everywhere,

35
00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:17.360
For everyone.

36
00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:25.640
In the name of Jesus Christ.

37
00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:28.140
Amen.
